  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Cloud service brokerage is a service that arbitrates, delivers and manages cloud services provided by cloud service providers for cloud service customers. Recommendation ITU-T Y.3506 provides functional requirements for cloud service brokerage. To provide functional requirements for cloud service brokerage, this Recommendation specifies the overview including service model and configuration of the cloud service brokerage. Various use cases are also identified to derive the functional requirements.</abstract>
